Package: kilix-voice
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, espeak-ng, ${misc:Depends}
Description: read-aloud and dictation commands
 Kilix Voice speaks text and can take dictation. This package installs
 kilix-tts, kilix-stt and kilix-voiced, plus the library they import.
 Read-aloud uses espeak-ng. Dictation models are not included; they stay
 a first-use download.
 .
 The commands are in /usr/bin and the library is in /usr/lib/kilix-voice.
